{"hw":"Ὀδυσσεύς","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Ὀδυσσεύς</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀδυσς-εύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">έως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ῆος, ὁ</span> (also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Οὐλιξεύς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdn.</span> </span> Gr.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.14</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Οὐλίξης</span> prob. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ibyc.</span> </span> ap. Diom.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.321</span> </span> K., <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλυσεύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλυσσεύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλυτεύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλυττεύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλισεύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὠλυσσεύς</span> Kretschmer <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Griech.Vaseninschr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">pp.146,147</span> </span>, al.; cf. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλισσεῖδαι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">οἱ</span>, a <span class=\"gk\">φάτρα</span> (q. v.) at Thebes and Argos, prob. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3659</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mnemos.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">43.372</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">47.164</span> </span>):—<div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Odysseus,</b> king of Ithaca, hero of the Odyssey: in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span> also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀδυσεύς</span>; gen. <span class=\"gk\">Ὀδυσεῦς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</spa