> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Schwyzer</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">434.16</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Magn.</span> </span> Mae., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B. C.</span>); <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀδύσσειον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">temple of Odysseus,</b> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀδυσήϊος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.353</span> </span>.</div></div>"}